{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/ee0d17624de0e3c3a364fb8401bc8fab.avif?t=1764850045\" width=616 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite action game set in a post-apocalyptic water world. Shape your strategy by choosing which abilities shine by day and which awaken at night.<br>Get ready for fast-paced combat, procedural generation, permadeath, and meta-progression.<br>You play as a volunteer sent to the surface in search of vital resources. Explore rust-covered platforms, fight hostile machines, collect loot, and upgrade your skills. Maybe your run will be the one that changes everything \u2014 and gives humanity a second chance.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/a6504a364e57620ff868f06089aa50e9.poster.avif?t=1764850045\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/a6504a364e57620ff868f06089aa50e9.webm?t=1764850045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/a6504a364e57620ff868f06089aa50e9.mp4?t=1764850045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Intensity Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are deadly and unforgiving. You'll need precise aim and constant movement to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some perks only work during the day, others \u2014 only at night. Plan your build wisely as time in the game moves forward relentlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Wide Arsenal of Weapons and Gadgets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match dozens of weapons and active items to handle any threat that comes your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural Generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels, enemies, and loot are generated from scratch each time \u2014 no two runs are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end. Upgrade your starting base to improve your chances in future runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Post-Apocalyptic Waterworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization fell in a war against soulless machines. Cities are submerged, and the last survivors hide in underwater bunkers, venturing to the surface only in search of resources.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859430?t=1764850045","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859430?t=1764850045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/7cbbabad6a164117026dd731883de36dee560b59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764850045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/7cbbabad6a164117026dd731883de36dee560b59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764850045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/ee0d17624de0e3c3a364fb8401bc8fab.avif?t=1764850045\" width=616 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite action game set in a post-apocalyptic water world. Shape your strategy by choosing which abilities shine by day and which awaken at night.<br>Get ready for fast-paced combat, procedural generation, permadeath, and meta-progression.<br>You play as a volunteer sent to the surface in search of vital resources. Explore rust-covered platforms, fight hostile machines, collect loot, and upgrade your skills. Maybe your run will be the one that changes everything \u2014 and gives humanity a second chance.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/a6504a364e57620ff868f06089aa50e9.poster.avif?t=1764850045\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/a6504a364e57620ff868f06089aa50e9.webm?t=1764850045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/a6504a364e57620ff868f06089aa50e9.mp4?t=1764850045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Intensity Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are deadly and unforgiving. You'll need precise aim and constant movement to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some perks only work during the day, others \u2014 only at night. Plan your build wisely as time in the game moves forward relentlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Wide Arsenal of Weapons and Gadgets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match dozens of weapons and active items to handle any threat that comes your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural Generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels, enemies, and loot are generated from scratch each time \u2014 no two runs are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end. Upgrade your starting base to improve your chances in future runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Post-Apocalyptic Waterworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization fell in a war against soulless machines. Cities are submerged, and the last survivors hide in underwater bunkers, venturing to the surface only in search of resources.</p>","developers":["R_Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/b9e76720c3ef2c5c8b3d184e8703ee9aea1f3901/header.jpg?t=1764850045","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859430/2004066808/49c941fa48cf7fe63961e4b1b6214c47afed637d/1759938701/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764850043","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859430/2004066808/49c941fa48cf7fe63961e4b1b6214c47afed637d/1759938701/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764850043","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859430/2004066808/49c941fa48cf7fe63961e4b1b6214c47afed637d/1759938701/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764850043","id":257214365,"name":"new trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214365/f661809651e589e6f89710c8f64bc5d3362c7eaf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764850043"}],"name":"Waterpunk: Through the Rust","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB graphics card with WebGL support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["R_Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00c3\u00aancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_g